48,east,"To complete the task, I plan to first find the stairs down, which are currently adjacent to the west. However, the stairs up are also nearby, and I have already taken damage by kicking the stairs up. To avoid further damage, I will first search the area to see if there are any hidden doors or passages that can lead me to the stairs down without having to navigate through the stairs up.

After searching, I will move north and east to try to find the stairs down. If the stairs down are not visible, I will use the wand of polymorph to try to see them.

If I am unable to find the stairs down, I will try to find another way down by searching for hidden doors or passages.

